; Exports of the xdb format plugin: 7-Zip's archive exports (third_party/7zip/CPP/7zip/Archive/
; Archive2.def) without the codec and hasher ones, plus GetFormatOptions, which the Tosox/7zip
; fork reads to build its "Format options" dialog. Listing it here keeps the name undecorated on Win32.

EXPORTS
  CreateObject PRIVATE

  GetHandlerProperty PRIVATE
  GetNumberOfFormats PRIVATE
  GetHandlerProperty2 PRIVATE
  GetIsArc PRIVATE

  SetLargePageMode PRIVATE
  SetCaseSensitive PRIVATE

  GetModuleProp PRIVATE

  GetFormatOptions PRIVATE
